{"product":{"id":10805553692956,"title":"Juniper Mahjong Tiles","body_html":"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eRich, lush, and effortlessly elegant, the Juniper Mahjong Tiles bring a deep, garden-inspired sophistication to your game table. Designed with a striking palette of forest green, jade, and warm coral pink accents, this set feels both bold and refined—like an evening stroll through a lush, lantern-lit garden.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eEach tile is thoughtfully illustrated with intricate pagodas, flowing lotus blooms, and refined linework that create a sophisticated and highly artful playing experience. The dot tiles feature layered floral medallions in a jewel-toned mix of pink, teal, and gold, while the bamboo suit incorporates ornate pink pagoda bridges and elegant stalks for a look that feels lush, dramatic, and elevated. Character tiles are rendered in a soft coral brushstroke script, balancing beauty and readability with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eThe dragon and pagoda tiles are a standout feature, showcasing an emerald dragon and delicate garden scenes rendered in a rich, painterly style. Designed to blend functionality with elegance, these details add both visual interest and ease of play while maintaining the set's cohesive aesthetic. Charming jester Joker tiles complete the collection with a playful yet polished touch that feels perfectly at home within the design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eRich, verdant, and full of thoughtful detail, the Juniper Tiles bring a sense of depth and celebration to every hand—perfect for hosting, gifting, or elevating your everyday Mahjong ritual.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's Included\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e160 Acrylic Tiles\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDice\/Coin Bag\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4 Instructional Cards\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTile Breakdown\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1–9 Bams, Cracks, and Dots (4 of each) = 108\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNorth, East, West, South Winds (4 of each) = 16\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRed, Green, and White Dragons (4 of each) = 12\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlowers (numbered) = 8\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eJokers = 10\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlanks = 6\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTile Size\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIndividual Tile: 0.87\" W x 0.6\" D x 1.25\" H\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eA rich, garden-inspired take on a timeless game—Juniper is where classic Mahjong meets deep, elevated elegance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlease Note:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Inspired by the rich beauty of jade, Juniper's tile backs feature subtle variations in color and pattern that give each tile its own unique character. These natural-looking differences are an intentional part of the design, making every set uniquely beautiful.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Oh My Mahjong","product_type":"Mahjong Tiles","created_at":"2026-03-30T16:06:22-05:00","handle":"juniper-mahjong-tiles","updated_at":"2026-11-03T12:13:32-06:00","published_at":"2026-11-03T08:01:11-06:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"global","tags":"juniper collection, numbered flowers, tag__new__NEW","variants":[{"id":54012158279964,"product_id":10805553692956,"title":"Default Title","price":"475.00","sku":"OMM544","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-03-30T16:06:22-05:00","updated_at":"2026-11-03T12:13:32-06:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"810168324647","gra